<title>INDONESIA: Bakrie &amp; Brothers H1 net soars.</title>
<headline>Bakrie &amp; Brothers H1 net soars.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   58.64 vs 39.23</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (in rupiah)   121 vs 81</p>
<p>    Revenues			    658.47 vs 549.55</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   91.33 vs 74.61</p>
<p>NOTE: PT Bakrie &amp; Brothers is a diversified group whose interests include pipe manufacturing, telecommunications and plantations.</p>
</text>
